OL,3,GNEWSABuy now or wait and hope? Families
OL,4,Aface gamble on heating oil
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the summer draws to a close,
OL,7,Ffamilies who rely on fuel oil to heat
OL,8,Ftheir homes are facing a dilemma.
OL,10,FThe price has almost doubled over the
OL,11,Fpast year, following the outbreak of
OL,12,Fconflict between the US and Iran.
OL,14,FIt has left people wondering whether to
OL,15,Fbuy now for the winter, or hold off in
OL,16,Fthe hope that prices will fall ` with
OL,17,Fthe risk that they could rise again.
OL,19,FJohn Craggs, 73, from Wigtoft, near
OL,20,FBoston, Lincolnshire, needs to fill his
OL,21,Ftank ahead of winter.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
